      "value": "Ender Disc"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "json": [
        {
          "text": "I've managed to create a disc that can "
        },
        {
          "text": "instantly perform a Ritual of Return",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": ". I just need to set the correct pattern in it, then it uses some of my mana to move me around. The Ender Disc can support multiple locations, each with a name.  \n\nIt cannot move between multiple dimensions, although the same combination used in different dimensions will work, teleporting me to the matching Homestead in the dimension I'm currently in.\n\nI can copy a homestead point to the disc's current pattern by sneaking and activating the point with the disc.\n\n"
        },
        {
          "text": "Quick select locations using the UI key (default 'z').",
          "italic": true
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "related_recipes": [
    {
      "type": "manaweaving_altar",
      "location": "mna:manaweaving/ender_disc"
    }
  ]
}